# Local sensitive tokens pattern file for PXMX-VE security checker
# Copy this file to 'security.tokens.local' and add your local hardware serials,
# local username, or private homelab IP addresses.
# 'security.tokens.local' is permanently excluded in .gitignore and NEVER committed.
# Format: <TOKEN>:<Description> or simply <TOKEN>

# MY_DEV_USER:Local dev username
# SERIAL123456789:Hardware device serial
# 192.168.1.50:Internal test server IP
